@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava demo korisnika (registrovan u 01-auth.http)
# @name demo
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "demo@dermawise.rs", "password": "demo123"}

### Upitnik: perzistentni centrofacijalni eritem, telangiektazije, flushing 3x nedeljno, 8 papula i 2 pustule, bez komedona
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../service/src/main/resources/questionnaires/rosacea-ppr.json

### FC primer 2: kriterijum rozaceje, akne isključene (nema komedona), PPR umerena, ivermektin + metronidazol čekaju dermatologa
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}

### Upitnik: papule oko usta, bez telangiektazija, skorašnji topijski kortikosteroid
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../service/src/main/resources/questionnaires/perioral-dermatitis.json

### Perioralni dermatitis: napomena o prekidu steroida i metronidazol 0.75% dva puta dnevno
POST {{host}}/api/analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
